            "review_title": "Review at Yobe Craft Beer",
            "review_text": "Barney Lee\n12 contributions\n1\nHighlt recommend for chill\nSep 2019\nThere are over 100 types of craft beer for your choosing. Staff is friendly and is willing to answer all your questions about beer then you can choose the most suitable one for you. If you want to find a place to chit chat with friends (as type not much noisy, just drink a little and talk) or can chill alone, Yobe is one of your best place for u. I will come back for sure\nWritten September 24, 2019\nPhuong Anh\nMany thanks for your touching review, we are highly appreciated!\nWritten September 25, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
