            "review_title": "Review at Yobe Craft Beer",
            "review_text": "Calvin T\nBangkok, Thailand53 contributions\n1\nAmazing little hidden gem\nAug 2019\nFifth time being here and this awesome place never lets me down. Great atmosphere, great food and great beer as well as great conversation with the lady owner. She offers a large collection of local/imported craft beer as well as canned beer ( some of the names I have never heard of). Whether you are here alone or as a group, you will always find a special spot to sit.Delicious snacks can be found here also.\nRead more\nWritten September 23, 2019\nPhuong Anh\nMany thanks, Calvin! we highly appreciated for your time spent with us. Hope to see you again soon.\nWritten September 26, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
